OL,3,GNEWSAPark and leisure centres given
OL,4,Afunding for upgrades
OL,5,
OL,6,FParks, leisure centres and community
OL,7,Ffacilities across Charnwood are to
OL,8,Freceive #4.3 million of investment from
OL,9,Fthe borough council.
OL,11,FThe authority is set to spend #1.8m
OL,12,Fupgrading heating, power and swimming
OL,13,Fpool systems at its three leisure
OL,14,Fcentres in Loughborough, Mountsorrel
OL,15,Fand Syston.
OL,17,FA further #1.6m will be spent on paths
OL,18,Fand play areas in parks, with a further
OL,19,F#250,000 going towards reopening public
OL,20,Ftoilets in Loughborough's Southfields
OL,21,FPark.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
