OL,3,GNEWSAPark and leisure centres given
OL,4,Afunding for upgrades
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council is also set to invest
OL,7,F#500,000 into upgrading and installing
OL,8,Fnew CCTV cameras and #150,000 on
OL,9,Fcatering facilities at Loughborough
OL,10,FTown Hall.
